Frontend Assignment: LearnSphere – Responsive Learning Platform
1. Project Overview
You are required to design and develop a responsive frontend application called LearnSphere, an online learning platform where students can explore courses, view their learning progress, filter courses, and manage their learning dashboard.
The main purpose of this project is to practice Tailwind CSS with React and apply the concepts learned during the training session.
This is a frontend-only project. No backend, database, authentication API, or external API integration is required.

2. Problem Statement
Online learning platforms contain different types of information such as available courses, student progress, course categories, learning statistics, and user information.
Your task is to build a modern and responsive Student Learning Dashboard that provides this information in a clean and user-friendly interface.
The application should work properly across:
• Mobile devices
• Tablets
• Laptops
• Desktop screens
The main challenge is to build the complete user interface using Tailwind CSS utility classes while maintaining responsive design, reusable React components, and clean code.

