11. Conditional Course Status Styling
Course status should have different styles.
Example:
Completed → Green
In Progress → Yellow
Not Started → Gray
Students should implement the status using conditional Tailwind classes.
Recommended approach:
const statusStyles = {
  Completed: "bg-green-100 text-green-700",
  "In Progress": "bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-700",
  "Not Started": "bg-gray-100 text-gray-700"
};
Students should avoid creating Tailwind classes dynamically like:
`bg-${color}-500`
The complete Tailwind class names should be available directly in the source code.

12. Progress Bar
