17. Responsive Design Requirements
The application must support multiple screen sizes.
Students must use Tailwind responsive utilities such as:
• sm:
• md:
• lg:
• xl:
The application must be tested at approximately:
Mobile: 375px
Tablet: 768px
Laptop: 1024px
Large Desktop: 1440px
The application must not have unwanted horizontal scrolling.

18. Mobile-First Requirement
The application should follow a mobile-first approach.
Students should first define the default mobile layout.
Then enhance the layout for larger screens using responsive prefixes.
Example concept:
className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"
Students should be able to explain what happens at each screen size.

