Final Goal
By completing this project, students should demonstrate that they can independently build a modern, responsive React user interface using Tailwind CSS.
The focus of the project is not only to create a visually attractive application but also to demonstrate a clear understanding of:
Tailwind utility classes, responsive design, mobile-first development, Flexbox, Grid, theme customization, custom fonts, conditional styling, reusable components, and maintainable frontend code.
